Revision history for Alien-gettext

{{$NEXT}}
    - Build on Alien::Build with an alienfile instead of the deprecated
      Alien::Base::ModuleBuild; the share build now downloads over https
      from ftp.gnu.org/gnu/gettext/ and builds static internal libraries
    - Probe for a system gettext by running msgfmt --version
    - Fix the dist summary typo ("an" for "and") and describe the dist as
      finding or building the GNU gettext command-line tools
    - Drop the unused Travis CI configuration

0.002     2026-09-19 02:53:52Z
    - Update dist config to current @Author::GETTY standards
    - Add msgmerge to the provided gettext tools

0.001     2014-09-18 22:37:56Z
    - Initial release
    - Install the GNU gettext command-line utilities via Alien::Base,
      using a system gettext or building it from the GNU FTP source
    - Tools reached through bin_dir: msgfmt, xgettext, msgcmp, msgcomm,
      msgfilter, msgexec, msguniq, msginit, msgunfmt, msgconv

